{"title": "Relentless Endurance", "pageid": 6277, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Relentless_Endurance", "categories": ["Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Relentless_Endurance.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Relentless_Endurance.webp/300px-Relentless_Endurance.webp, /w/images/3/38/Relentless_Endurance.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Relentless_Endurance.webp/300px-Relentless_Endurance.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/38/Relentless_Endurance.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Relentless Endurance</b> is a passive feature available to <a href=\"/wiki/Half-Orc\" title=\"Half-Orc\">Half-Orc</a> characters. Once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>, when they are reduced to 0 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> but not killed outright, they can drop to 1 Hit Point instead.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>If you reach 0 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">hit points</a>, you regain <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> instead of becoming <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Downed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\">Downed</a>. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Half-Orc\" title=\"Half-Orc\">Half-Orc</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Kerz\" title=\"Kerz\">Kerz</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Skoona\" title=\"Skoona\">Skoona</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Upon reaching 0 <a href=\"/wiki/HP\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"HP\">HP</a>, regains 1 HP, once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">long rest</a>.</div>\n</div> \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200053\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1138/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9293/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3685/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 166/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 727684/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.774      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   39.774